# Build context of apps/web/Dockerfile is the repository root (C-145): send only the web app, the
# workspace packages and the pnpm files. Never .env files.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches/
!packages/
!apps/web/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/e2e/.auth
apps/web/e2e/.stack.json
